- notice_7_days_overdue: Firm but professional. Express concern. Request immediate payment. Mention possible late fees.
- final_notice_14_days: Serious tone. State this is a final notice. Mention next steps if unpaid.

Business name: {{ $env.BUSINESS_NAME }}
Business phone: {{ $env.BUSINESS_PHONE }}
Business email: {{ $env.BUSINESS_EMAIL }}

Return JSON with:
{
  "subject": "email subject line",
  "body": "full email body in plain text",
  "urgency": "low|medium|high|critical"
}

